WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.590
- Put some more in here, it is 2017,

00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:05.333
Auntie got time today,
I got time this holiday.

00:00:05.333 --> 00:00:08.750
(electronic dance music)

00:00:11.059 --> 00:00:13.020
You're 21 now right,
'cause we 'bout to drink.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.135
Don't tell your momma.

00:00:14.135 --> 00:00:17.250
(electronic dance music)

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:18.660
You gonna need a new
tablecloth for all the tea

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.620
I'm getting ready to spill, I know that.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.930
That's why he can't keep a girl now,

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:23.230
that's why he got three baby mommas,

00:00:23.230 --> 00:00:24.063
cause he always out here.

00:00:24.063 --> 00:00:25.360
Uh-uh, a little bit more.

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:27.250
Them degrees ain't gonna
keep you warm at night now.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.670
Find yourself somebody on the yard,

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.220
preferably not light-skinned,

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.160
'cause they don't know how to act.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:34.550
Me and your daddy never got along.

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:35.820
He used to say I drank too much,

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.460
I don't know why he would
ever say I drink too much

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:39.990
and your mother would
agree, my own sister.

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.078
- Have you heard of this
new app called The Bible?

00:00:42.078 --> 00:00:44.190
(lively choir music)

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:45.250
Here you go, baby.

00:00:46.564 --> 00:00:50.310
(wrapping paper crinkles)

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:52.412
- [Niece] Oh great, another Bible.

00:00:52.412 --> 00:00:55.110
(choir music continues)

00:00:55.110 --> 00:00:55.943
- You're welcome.

00:00:55.943 --> 00:00:57.980
Father, God, I thank
you, Jesus, for this food

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:00.580
as it nourishes our souls, our
mind, and our spirits today,

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:03.040
tomorrow, and the day after that, God.

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.130
We thank you for your blessings

00:01:04.130 --> 00:01:06.250
and for the new Bible my baby got.

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.195
- Now I know how Mariah feels.

00:01:08.195 --> 00:01:10.600
(classical music)

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:13.350
You know, Winston and I just
got back from Bora Bora.

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:15.080
It was a marvelous time.

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:19.120
Your mother, she's always
been a little envious of me.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.630
And I love her, but it
was never in her cards.

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:24.660
I remember us being three years old

00:01:24.660 --> 00:01:27.740
and her picking Rose Art over Crayola.

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:28.670
Who does that?

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:30.260
What's a girl gonna do? (laughs)

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:32.550
You just gotta let go and let God.

00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:34.914
(laughs)

00:01:34.914 --> 00:01:38.189
- You remember my roommate, Sarah, right?

00:01:38.189 --> 00:01:40.856
(hip-hop music)

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:43.428
- Dating, dating anyone?

00:01:43.428 --> 00:01:45.090
(laughs)

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:48.880
No, I've been slammed,
between work and school.

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:52.290
I'm getting my third degree, PhD.

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:53.790
I'm focusin' on me right now.

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:55.640
Last month I was actually in Miami.

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:57.800
It was for this weird
thing called Sweet Heat.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:00.570
It was all females, women empowerment.

00:02:00.570 --> 00:02:02.860
I'm really about that, I'm a big feminist.

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:06.660
I met a lot of friends,
got a lot of new friends.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:08.960
- Oh my god, you are glowing.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:11.474
Have you been drinking
the kombucha I sent?

00:02:11.474 --> 00:02:13.570
(funky music)

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:16.360
I made y'all some brownies.

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:18.803
Your mom used to love these.

00:02:18.803 --> 00:02:20.970
Don't tell her I gave you them though.

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:22.850
What do you mean you're out of kale?

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:25.680
What do you have that's locally sourced?

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:29.680
I can't do sugar, I can't do
oil, I can't do seasonings.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:32.780
Is there anything you guys can
hook up for me in the back?

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:35.320
Okay, ya, you know what,

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:37.689
just bring me a bread basket, thanks.

00:02:37.689 --> 00:02:38.910
- [Server] I can do that.

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:40.580
- It feels so good to have money.

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:43.289
Do you see this coat? (laughs)

00:02:43.289 --> 00:02:44.640
- I earned this.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:45.620
- About to get high as fuck.

00:02:45.620 --> 00:02:47.300
- No, I need some wine to deal with y'all,

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.610
my messy ass sisters, and
their trifling ass husbands.

00:02:49.610 --> 00:02:52.090
I can't stand none of them
and their badass kids.

00:02:52.090 --> 00:02:53.960
That's why I have kids,
that's what I tell everybody.

00:02:53.960 --> 00:02:56.350
You can't drink when you
pregnant and got young children.

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:57.810
No, no.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:00.727
(bright pop music)

